{"sha": "ff7713161627d2b54f52beb94983e6d30875a04255fc232ac4283c753fe97bab", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:randvar} 章 --- 随机变量与二项分布}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:randvar:1}", "$\\E(X) = -0.3 + 0 + 0.8 + 0.5 = 1$。", "$\\E(X^2) = 0.3 \\times 1 + 0 + 0.4\\times4 + 0.1\\times25 = 4.4$，由", "柯尼希–惠更斯公式得 $\\V(X) = 4.4 - 1 = 3.4$，且", "$\\sigma(X) = \\sqrt{3.4} \\approx 1.84$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:randvar:2}", "\\emph{1.} 这 $10$ 个问题是独立的伯努利试验，其中", "$p = \\frac14$：$X \\sim \\mathcal B\\left(10, \\frac14\\right)$，", "$\\E(X) = 2.5$，", "$\\sigma(X) = \\sqrt{10 \\times \\frac14 \\times \\frac34} = \\sqrt{1.875}", "\\approx 1.37$。", "", "\\emph{2.} $\\P(X = 0) = \\left(\\frac34\\right)^{10} \\approx 0.056$；", "\\[", "\\P(X = 5) = \\binom{10}{5}\\left(\\frac14\\right)^5\\left(\\frac34\\right)^5", "\\approx 0.058;", "\\quad", "\\P(X \\geq 1) = 1 - \\left(\\tfrac34\\right)^{10} \\approx 0.944 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:randvar:3}", "独立同分布的试验：$X \\sim \\mathcal B(400,\\ 0.05)$，于是", "期望理赔次数为 $\\E(X) = 20$，且", "\\[", "\\sigma(X) = \\sqrt{400 \\times 0.05 \\times 0.95} = \\sqrt{19} \\approx 4.4 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:randvar:4}", "收到的付款 $P$ 满足", "$\\E(P) = \\frac{5 + 6}{6} = \\frac{11}{6}$，因此公平价格为", "$c = \\frac{11}{6} \\approx 1.83$ 欧元。公平收益 $G = P - \\frac{11}6$", "取值为 $-\\frac{11}{6}, \\frac{19}{6}, \\frac{25}{6}$，概率分别为", "$\\frac46, \\frac16, \\frac16$：", "\\[", "\\V(G) = \\E(G^2)", "= \\frac{4 \\times 121 + 361 + 625}{6 \\times 36} = \\frac{1470}{216}", "= \\frac{245}{36} \\approx 6.8,", "\\qquad \\sigma(G) \\approx 2.6 .", "\\]", "公平游戏的\\emph{平均}收益为零，但其结果仍有波动：", "公平并不等于无风险。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:randvar:5}", "$X \\sim \\mathcal B(8,\\ 0.7)$。", "\\[", "\\P(X = 6) = \\binom86 (0.7)^6(0.3)^2 \\approx 0.296 ;", "\\]", "\\[", "\\P(X \\geq 6) = \\P(6) + \\P(7) + \\P(8)", "\\approx 0.296 + 8(0.7)^7(0.3) + (0.7)^8", "\\approx 0.296 + 0.198 + 0.058 = 0.552 ;", "\\]", "$\\P(X \\geq 1) = 1 - (0.3)^8 \\approx 0.99993$。众数：", "$(n+1)p = 6.3$，故最可能的取值为 $k^* = 6$", "（\\cref{exo:g12:randvar:7}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:randvar:6}", "乘客到场人数为 $X \\sim \\mathcal B(104,\\ 0.9)$；当", "$X \\geq 101$ 时航班超售：", "\\[", "\\P(X \\geq 101) = \\sum_{k=101}^{104}\\binom{104}{k}(0.9)^k(0.1)^{104-k}", "\\approx 0.006 .", "\\]", "多售 $4\\%$ 的机票，仅使约", "$0.6\\%$ 的航班出现意外——这正是超售背后的经济学道理。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:randvar:7}", "\\[", "\\frac{\\P(X = k+1)}{\\P(X = k)}", "= \\frac{\\binom{n}{k+1}}{\\binom nk}\\cdot\\frac{p}{1-p}", "= \\frac{n - k}{k + 1}\\cdot\\frac{p}{1-p},", "\\]", "利用 $\\binom{n}{k+1} = \\binom nk \\frac{n-k}{k+1}$。该比值 $\\geq 1$", "当且仅当 $(n-k)p \\geq (k+1)(1-p)$，亦即 $np - k p \\geq k - kp + 1 - p$，当且仅当", "$k \\leq (n+1)p - 1$。故概率在", "$k + 1 \\leq (n+1)p$ 时严格递增，此后递减，最大值在", "$k^* = \\floor{(n+1)p}$ 处取得（与 $k^* - 1$ 同时取得，当", "$(n+1)p$ 为整数时）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:randvar:8}", "\\emph{1.} 首次出现正面在第 $k$ 次投掷，即前 $k-1$ 次为反面，随后出现正面：", "概率为 $\\left(\\frac12\\right)^{k-1}\\cdot\\frac12 = 2^{-k}$，其中", "$1 \\leq k \\leq 10$。获胜的总概率为", "$\\sum_{k=1}^{10} 2^{-k} = 1 - 2^{-10} = \\frac{1023}{1024}$（仅在", "连续十次反面时游戏失败）。", "", "\\emph{2.} 期望收益：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{10} 2^k \\cdot 2^{-k} = \\sum_{k=1}^{10} 1 = 10 \\text{ 欧元}.", "\\]", "若无上限，则和式 $\\sum_{k\\geq1} 1$ 发散，期望收益为", "无穷，尽管游戏几乎总是只支付一小笔钱——这正是", "著名的 \\emph{圣彼得堡悖论}，说明仅凭期望", "并不能衡量一个游戏的价值。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:randvar:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $X \\sim \\mathcal B\\!\\left(3, \\frac16\\right)$：", "$\\P(X = 0) = \\frac{125}{216}$，", "$\\P(X = 1) = \\frac{75}{216}$，", "$\\P(X = 2) = \\frac{15}{216}$，", "$\\P(X = 3) = \\frac{1}{216}$。", ""]}